---
description: Section separator comment style for grouping members in C++ files
globs: **/*.{h,cpp}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Section Separators

Group related members/functions under dash-banner comments so files read top-to-bottom.

## Format

- `// ------------------ Title ------------------` (space after `//`, dashes both sides).
- Place the banner under the relevant access specifier, not on the same line as it.
- Blank line after the banner.
- Use Title Case, short names (e.g. `Public API`, `Designer knobs`, `Runtime state`).

## Example

```cpp
protected:
    // ------------------ Bound widgets ------------------

    UPROPERTY( BlueprintReadOnly, meta = ( BindWidget ) )
    TObjectPtr<USizeBox> ViewportSizeBox;

private:
    // ------------------ Motion state ------------------

    /** Fractional strip motion; 0 when settled. Positive moves icons up (toward next). */
    float ScrollOffset = 0.f;

    /** Queued scroll steps not yet committed (+ next / - previous). */
    int32 PendingScrollSteps = 0;
```

## Avoid

```cpp
    //~ Bound widgets            // no dash banner
    //------------------ x ---   // missing space after //
    // ---- x ----  public:      // banner sharing the access-specifier line
```
